  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation : 78 + 3 ÷ 26 - 8 × 24 = 25 \n\nNow, by interchanging the signs\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷ and x\n\n78 + 3 ÷ 26 - 8 × 24 = 25 ⇒ 78 + 3 x 26 - **8 ÷ 24**__ = 25 \n\n78 + __**3 **____**x**____** 26**__ - 0.33 = 25\n\n__**78 + 78**__ - 0.33 = 25\n\n__**156 - 0.33**__ = 25\n\n155.67 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : ÷ and +​\n\n78 + 3 ÷ 26 - 8 × 24 = 25 ⇒ **78 ÷ 3**__ + 26 - 8 × 24 = 25\n\n26 + 26 - __**8 × 24**__ = 25\n\n__**26 **____**+ 26**__ - 192 = 25\n\n__**52 -192**__ = 25\n\n140 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : + and - \n\n78 + 3 ÷ 26 - 8 × 24 = 25 ⇒ 78 - **3 ÷ 26**__ + 8 × 24 = 25 \n\n78 - 0.11 + __**8 × 24**__ = 25\n\n__**78 **____**+ 192**__ - 0.11 = 25\n\n__**270 - 0.11**__ = 25\n\n269.89 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n\n \n• Option - (4) : × and +\n\n78 + 3 ÷ 26 - 8 × 24 = 25 ⇒ 78 × **3 ÷ 26**__ - 8 + 24 = 25\n\n__**78 × 0.11**__- 8 + 24 = 25\n\n__**9 + 24**__ -8 = 25 \n\n__**33 - 8**__ = 25\n\n**25 = 25 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
